AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000009 "Adult neuron belonging to group 010 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the anterior optic tubercle (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the anterior optic tubercle, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the anterior optic tubercle, posterior lateral protocerebrum and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
