AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000047 "Adult neuron belonging to group 048 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the anterior optic tubercle (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the anterior optic tubercle, gnathal ganglion, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior bridge, ventrolateral neuropils, wedge, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the anterior optic tubercle, gnathal ganglion, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior bridge, ventrolateral neuropils, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
