# Class: obo:FBbt_20000071 (adult antler neuron 007)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000071 "Adult neuron belonging to group 007 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the antler (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, mushroom body, superior medial protocerebrum, mushroom body gamma-lobe, lateral complex, inferior neuropils, inferior bridge, superior neuropils, crepine and antler (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, lateral complex, inferior neuropils, inferior bridge, superior neuropils and antler (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20000071 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
