# Class: obo:FBbt_20000088 (adult antler neuron 024)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000088 "Adult neuron belonging to group 024 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the antler (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, superior clamp, inferior bridge, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum, crepine and antler (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the inferior neuropils, inferior bridge and antler (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
