# Class: obo:FBbt_20000131 (adult anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 022)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000131 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the AVLP022 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior-lateral to the lateral horn (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the LHl2 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the contralateral inferior clamp, the contralateral mushroom body pedunculus and the contralateral superior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral inferior clamp, the contralateral mushroom body pedunculus, the contralateral superior clamp and the ipsilateral inferior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20000131 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
