AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000136 "Adult neuron belonging to group 027 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
