AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000199 "Adult neuron belonging to group 090 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
