# Class: obo:FBbt_20000259 (adult anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 150)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000259 "Adult neuron belonging to group 150 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the inferior neuropils, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, superior clamp and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the inferior neuropils and superior clamp (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
