AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000275 "Adult neuron belonging to group 166 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, gorget, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, gorget, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
