# Class: obo:FBbt_20000364 (adult anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 255)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000364 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the AVLP255 group, with its soma in the brain, near to the accessory medulla (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the LALa1 anterior hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the contralateral inferior clamp, the contralateral epaulette and the contralateral gorget (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the contralateral epaulette, the ipsilateral epaulette, the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the contralateral gorget, the ipsilateral gorget and the contralateral vest (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is gaba (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 3 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
