# Class: obo:FBbt_20000581 (adult anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 472)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000581 "Adult neuron belonging to group 472 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, superior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
