AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000602 "Adult neuron belonging to group 493 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
