# Class: obo:FBbt_20000670 (adult anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 561)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000670 "Adult neuron belonging to group 561 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, vest, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, vest, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
