# Class: obo:FBbt_20000726 (adult clamp neuron 021)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000726 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CL021 group, with its soma in the brain, lateral to the anterior optic tubercle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It is a putative embryonic-born neuron (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral lateral horn, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral crepine, the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum and the contralateral crepine (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral crepine, the contralateral crepine, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe and the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20000726 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20000726 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
