# Class: obo:FBbt_20000781 (adult clamp neuron 076)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000781 "Adult neuron belonging to group 076 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the clamp (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the mushroom body, superior lateral protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, mushroom body dorsal accessory calyx, ventrolateral neuropils and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, superior clamp, inferior clamp and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
