AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20000828 "Adult neuron belonging to group 123 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the clamp (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, epaulette, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the inferior neuropils, superior clamp, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
