AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001000 "Adult neuron belonging to group 295 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the clamp (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, superior clamp, inferior clamp, inferior bridge and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, superior clamp, inferior clamp, inferior bridge and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
