# Class: obo:FBbt_20001030 (adult descending neuron of the posterior brain DNpe024)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97766.1") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001030 "Adult descending neuron of the posterior brain of the DNpe024 group (Berg et al., 2026). It belongs to the PSp2 hemilineage (Berg et al., 2026). It receives input in the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, gorget, epaulette, vest, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, superior posterior slope and T1 leg neuropil, and the gnathal ganglion, inferior bridge, lower tectulum and intermediate tectulum (Berg et al., 2026). It sends output to the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, vest, inferior posterior slope, T1 leg neuropil and T2 leg neuropil, and the gnathal ganglion, lower tectulum and intermediate tectulum (Berg et al., 2026). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024; Berg et al., 2026).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001030 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001030 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20001030 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20001030 "CL325")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97766.1") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20001030 "DNxn153")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20001030 "FBbt:20001030")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20001030 "Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Scheffer et al., 2020; Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024; Berg et al., 2026). Synapse locations are given where each cell of this type in neuprint has at least 10 connections. Hemilineage information from neuprint, though original source not clear.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20001030 "adult descending neuron of the posterior brain DNpe024")
