# Class: obo:FBbt_20001042 (adult clamp neuron 337)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001042 "Adult neuron belonging to group 337 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the clamp (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, anterior optic tubercle, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, inferior bridge, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils and vest (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001042 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001042 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
