AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001083 "Adult neuron belonging to group 014 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, vest, superior neuropils and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, vest and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
