# Class: obo:FBbt_20001192 (adult inferior bridge neuron 015)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001192 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the IB015 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the lateral horn (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the LHp2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the contralateral inferior bridge, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the contralateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral mushroom body pedunculus and the contralateral superior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral inferior bridge, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral inferior bridge, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the contralateral inferior clamp, the contralateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral mushroom body pedunculus and the contralateral mushroom body pedunculus (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001192 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
