# Class: obo:FBbt_20001301 (adult lateral accessory lobe neuron 005)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001301 "Adult neuron belonging to group 005 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the lateral accessory lobe (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, lateral complex, superior neuropils and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe and lateral complex (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001301 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
