# Class: obo:FBbt_20001321 (adult lateral accessory lobe neuron 025)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001321 "Adult neuron belonging to group 025 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the lateral accessory lobe (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, anterior optic tubercle, gnathal ganglion, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, epaulette, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the gnathal ganglion, ventromedial neuropils, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001321 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001321 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
