# Class: obo:FBbt_20001377 (adult lateral accessory lobe neuron 081)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001377 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the LAL081 group, with its soma in the brain, ventral to the antennal lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the LALv1 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope, the ipsilateral wedge and the ipsilateral epaulette (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, the ipsilateral wedge and the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001377 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001377 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
