AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20001402 "Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Scheffer et al., 2020; Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024; Berg et al., 2026). Synapse locations are given where each cell of this type in neuprint has at least 10 connections.")
