# Class: obo:FBbt_20001430 (adult lateral accessory lobe neuron 134)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001430 "Adult neuron belonging to group 134 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the lateral accessory lobe (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, vest, superior clamp, inferior bridge, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum, crepine, antler and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, vest, inferior bridge, superior neuropils, crepine and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001430 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
