# Class: obo:FBbt_20001488 (adult lateral accessory lobe neuron 192)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001488 "Adult neuron belonging to group 192 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the lateral accessory lobe (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, superior clamp, inferior clamp, superior neuropils, crepine and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, lateral complex, inferior neuropils and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
