# Class: obo:FBbt_20001489 (adult lateral accessory lobe neuron 193)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001489 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the LAL193 group, with its soma in the brain, dorsal to the superior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the DM6 central2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe and the ipsilateral crepine (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral vest, the contralateral flange, the contralateral cantle, the contralateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral cantle, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral vest and the ipsilateral flange (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001489 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001489 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20001489 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20001489 "FBbt:20001489")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20001489 "Uncharacterized putative cell type based on Hemibrain data (Scheffer et al., 2020) and updated using FlyWire (FAFB) data (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). Soma locations are based on the closest annotated neuropil region. Pre- or post-synapse locations are the fewest regions that collectively contain at least 80 percent of all pre- or post-synapses of these neurons in FlyWire. Neurotransmitter predictions are from Eckstein et al. (2024). Other annotations are based on annotations in FlyWire and are available in the supplemental material of Schlegel et al. (2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20001489 "adult lateral accessory lobe neuron 193")
SubClassOf(obo:FBbt_20001489 obo:FBbt_00052046)
