# Class: obo:FBbt_20001503 (adult posterior lateral protocerebrum neuron 003)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001503 "Adult neuron belonging to group 003 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior lateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral horn, superior lateral protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
