# Class: obo:FBbt_20001511 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP74)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001511 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP74 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the LHl3 hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, lobula layer 5A and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp and inferior clamp (Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 2 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001511 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
