# Class: obo:FBbt_20001551 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP91)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001551 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP91 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, superior posterior slope, lobula layer 5A and lobula layer 5B, the contralateral vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum and superior posterior slope, and the inferior bridge and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the contralateral vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp and superior posterior slope, and the saddle (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001551 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001551 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20001551 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20001551 "PLP051")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20001551 "FBbt:20001551")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20001551 "Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Scheffer et al., 2020; Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). Synapse locations are given where each cell of this type in neuprint has at least 10 connections. Other information from Nern et al. (2025) supplements.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20001551 "adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP91")
