AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001556 "Adult neuron belonging to group 056 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior lateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
