# Class: obo:FBbt_20001566 (adult posterior lateral protocerebrum neuron 066)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001566 "Adult neuron belonging to group 066 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior lateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the mushroom body, superior lateral protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, mushroom body dorsal accessory calyx, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
