# Class: obo:FBbt_20001568 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP105)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001568 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP105 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the SLPav1 medial hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lateral horn, lobula layer 6 and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral lateral horn and lobula layer 6 (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001568 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001568 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
