# Class: obo:FBbt_20001588 (adult posterior lateral protocerebrum neuron 088)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001588 "Adult neuron belonging to group 088 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior lateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the inferior neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the inferior neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
