# Class: obo:FBbt_20001591 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP100)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001591 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP100 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral antennal lobe, lobula layer 6, vest, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, superior posterior slope and lobula layer 5B, and the inferior bridge and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, antennal lobe, vest, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, superior posterior slope and flange, and the gnathal ganglion, inferior bridge and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
