# Class: obo:FBbt_20001601 (adult posterior lateral protocerebrum neuron 101)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001601 "Adult neuron belonging to group 101 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior lateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils and wedge (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, wedge and inferior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
