# Class: obo:FBbt_20001618 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP36)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001618 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP36 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the SLPpl2 hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lobula layer 6 and posterior lateral protocerebrum (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral lobula layer 6 and posterior lateral protocerebrum (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001618 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001618 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
