# Class: obo:FBbt_20001625 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP39)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001625 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP39 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the SLPpl2 hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lobula layer 6, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, lobula layer 5A and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum and inferior clamp (Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 2 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001625 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001625 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
