# Class: obo:FBbt_20001646 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP60)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001646 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP60 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum and superior clamp, and the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum, superior clamp and inferior clamp (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum and superior clamp, and the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum, superior clamp and inferior clamp (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
