# Class: obo:FBbt_20001653 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP16)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001653 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP16 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the VPNp&v1 posterior hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp and inferior clamp (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 5 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001653 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
