# Class: obo:FBbt_20001751 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP97)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001751 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP97 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, pedunculus of mushroom body, lobula layer 6, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp and superior posterior slope, and the inferior bridge (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, pedunculus of mushroom body, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp and superior posterior slope (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
