# Class: obo:FBbt_20001824 (adult descending neuron of the anterior ventral brain DNbe005)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97766.1") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001824 "Adult descending neuron of the anterior ventral brain of the DNbe005 group (Berg et al., 2026). It receives input in the ipsilateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, wedge, superior posterior slope, inferior posterior slope, cantle and wing neuropil, the contralateral wedge, superior posterior slope, inferior posterior slope and wing neuropil, and the gnathal ganglion, inferior bridge, lower tectulum, intermediate tectulum and abdominal neuromere (Berg et al., 2026). It sends output to the ipsilateral wing neuropil, T1 leg neuropil and neck neuropil, the contralateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center, wing neuropil, T1 leg neuropil and neck neuropil, and the gnathal ganglion, ventromedial neuropils, lower tectulum, intermediate tectulum and abdominal neuromere (Berg et al., 2026).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001824 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001824 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20001824 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97766.1") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20001824 "DNxn007")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20001824 "PS069")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20001824 "FBbt:20001824")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20001824 "Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Scheffer et al., 2020; Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024; Berg et al., 2026). Synapse locations are given where each cell of this type in neuprint has at least 10 connections.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20001824 "adult descending neuron of the anterior ventral brain DNbe005")
