AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001885 "Adult medulla visual centrifugal neuron of the MeVC4a group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the DM1 posterior hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral gorget, vest, inferior clamp, superior posterior slope and cantle, the contralateral medulla serpentine layer, medulla layer M8, gorget, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, superior posterior slope, inferior posterior slope, flange and cantle, and the gnathal ganglion, inferior bridge and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the contralateral medulla serpentine layer, medulla layer M8 and medulla layer M9 (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
