# Class: obo:FBbt_20001886 (adult posterior slope neuron 131)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001886 "Adult neuron belonging to group 131 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, inferior bridge and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001886 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001886 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
