AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001962 "Adult neuron belonging to group 207 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, epaulette, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, inferior bridge, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, antler and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001962 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001962 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:FBbt_20001962 "adult PS207 neuron")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20001962 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20001962 "FBbt:20001962")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20001962 "Uncharacterized putative cell type (based on clustering analysis) from Janelia hemibrain data (Scheffer et al., 2020). Connectivity based on Hemibrain v1.2.1 data where each individual of this type has at least 10 synapses in a region.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20001962 "adult posterior slope neuron 207")
