# Class: obo:FBbt_20001963 (adult posterior slope neuron 208)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20001963 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the PS208 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the superior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the VLPp2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope, the contralateral superior posterior slope and the contralateral inferior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope and the contralateral inferior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 10 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20001963 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20001963 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20001963 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20001963 "FBbt:20001963")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20001963 "Uncharacterized putative cell type based on Hemibrain data (Scheffer et al., 2020) and updated using FlyWire (FAFB) data (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). Soma locations are based on the closest annotated neuropil region. Pre- or post-synapse locations are the fewest regions that collectively contain at least 80 percent of all pre- or post-synapses of these neurons in FlyWire. Neurotransmitter predictions are from Eckstein et al. (2024). Other annotations are based on annotations in FlyWire and are available in the supplemental material of Schlegel et al. (2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20001963 "adult posterior slope neuron 208")
SubClassOf(obo:FBbt_20001963 obo:FBbt_00052046)
