# Class: obo:FBbt_20002028 (adult posterior slope neuron 273)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002028 "Adult visual projection neuron of the PS273 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the superior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the PSp3 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral lobula (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the contralateral superior posterior slope and the ipsilateral inferior bridge (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 9 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002028 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
