# Class: obo:FBbt_20002032 (adult lobula plate tangential neuron LPT59)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002032 "Adult lobula plate tangential neuron of the LPT59 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center, posterior lateral protocerebrum, wedge, superior posterior slope, inferior posterior slope and cantle, the contralateral lobula plate layer 2, lobula plate layer 3, lobula plate layer 4, posterior lateral protocerebrum and superior posterior slope, and the gnathal ganglion, inferior bridge and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center, posterior lateral protocerebrum, wedge, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope, the contralateral lobula plate layer 2, lobula plate layer 3, lobula plate layer 4, posterior lateral protocerebrum and superior posterior slope, and the inferior bridge and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002032 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002032 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20002032 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20002032 "PS277")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20002032 "cLP05")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20002032 "FBbt:20002032")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20002032 "Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Scheffer et al., 2020; Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). Synapse locations are given where each cell of this type in neuprint has at least 10 connections. Other information from Nern et al. (2025) supplements.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20002032 "adult lobula plate tangential neuron LPT59")
