# Class: obo:FBbt_20002056 (adult lobula plate tangential neuron LPT110)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002056 "Adult lobula plate tangential neuron of the LPT110 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lobula plate layer 2, lobula plate layer 3, lobula plate layer 4, epaulette, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, wedge and superior posterior slope (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral lobula plate layer 1, lobula plate layer 2, lobula plate layer 3, lobula plate layer 4, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp and superior posterior slope (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002056 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002056 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20002056 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20002056 "PS301")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20002056 "cLP04")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20002056 "FBbt:20002056")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20002056 "Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Scheffer et al., 2020; Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). Synapse locations are given where each cell of this type in neuprint has at least 10 connections. Other information from Nern et al. (2025) supplements.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20002056 "adult lobula plate tangential neuron LPT110")
