# Class: obo:FBbt_20002057 (adult posterior slope neuron 302)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002057 "Adult neuron belonging to group 302 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, gnathal ganglion, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, ventrolateral neuropils, wedge, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, wedge, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
