# Class: obo:FBbt_20002081 (adult posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 023)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002081 "Adult neuron belonging to group 023 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the antennal mechanosensory and motor center, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, epaulette, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, wedge, periesophageal neuropils and saddle (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the antennal mechanosensory and motor center, giant fiber neuron, ventromedial neuropils, epaulette, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, wedge, periesophageal neuropils and saddle (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002081 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
