# Class: obo:FBbt_20002149 (adult posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 091)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002149 "Adult neuron belonging to group 091 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral horn, gnathal ganglion, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, superior posterior slope, periesophageal neuropils and saddle (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the inferior neuropils, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002149 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002149 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
