AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20002149 "Uncharacterized putative cell type (based on clustering analysis) from Janelia hemibrain data (Scheffer et al., 2020). Connectivity based on Hemibrain v1.2.1 data where each individual of this type has at least 10 synapses in a region.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20002149 "adult posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 091")
