AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002183 "Adult neuron belonging to group 125 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils and wedge (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
