# Class: obo:FBbt_20002189 (adult posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 131)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002189 "Adult neuron belonging to group 131 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, gorget, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, gorget, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp and ventrolateral neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
