# Class: obo:FBbt_20002259 (adult saddle neuron 050)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002259 "Adult neuron belonging to group 050 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the saddle (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the antennal mechanosensory and motor center, gnathal ganglion, ventromedial neuropils, epaulette, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, wedge, superior posterior slope, inferior posterior slope, periesophageal neuropils and saddle (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, antennal mechanosensory and motor center, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, epaulette, vest, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, wedge, superior posterior slope, periesophageal neuropils and saddle (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
