# Class: obo:FBbt_20002280 (adult saddle neuron 071)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002280 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the SAD071 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior-dorsal to the antennal mechanosensory and motor center (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the VESa2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the gnathal ganglia, the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral antennal lobe, the ipsilateral vest, the saddle, the ipsilateral flange and the contralateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the gnathal ganglia, the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the contralateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral vest, the ipsilateral posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral antennal lobe and the saddle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is gaba (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002280 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002280 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
