# Class: obo:FBbt_20002325 (adult superior intermediate protocerebrum neuron 021)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002325 "Adult neuron belonging to group 021 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the ventromedial neuropils and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
