# Class: obo:FBbt_20002327 (adult superior intermediate protocerebrum neuron 023)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002327 "Adult neuron belonging to group 023 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, mushroom body, superior medial protocerebrum, anterior optic tubercle, mushroom body alpha'-lobe, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, epaulette, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum, crepine, superior posterior slope and mushroom body alpha' lobe slice 1 (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, epaulette, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and superior posterior slope (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
