# Class: obo:FBbt_20002328 (adult superior intermediate protocerebrum neuron 024)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002328 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the SIP024 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior to the mushroom body vertical lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the CREa2 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral crepine, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral anterior optic tubercle, the ipsilateral inferior clamp and the gnathal ganglia (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the gnathal ganglia, the ipsilateral vest, the saddle, the ipsilateral cantle, the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum and the ipsilateral crepine (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 7 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002328 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
