# Class: obo:FBbt_20002330 (adult superior intermediate protocerebrum neuron 026)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002330 "Adult neuron belonging to group 026 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the mushroom body, superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, mushroom body beta'-lobe, mushroom body gamma-lobe, inferior neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum, crepine, mushroom body gamma lobe slice 4 and mushroom body beta' lobe slice 2 (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, superior neuropils and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
