# Class: obo:FBbt_20002362 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP82)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002362 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP82 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the VLPd&p1 posterior hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, lobula layer 6 and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 2 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002362 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002362 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
