# Class: obo:FBbt_20002368 (adult superior intermediate protocerebrum neuron 064)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002368 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the SIP064 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the antler (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It is a putative embryonic-born neuron (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum and the ipsilateral crepine (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral crepine, the contralateral crepine, the contralateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum and the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002368 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002368 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20002368 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20002368 "FBbt:20002368")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20002368 "Uncharacterized putative cell type based on Hemibrain data (Scheffer et al., 2020) and updated using FlyWire (FAFB) data (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). Soma locations are based on the closest annotated neuropil region. Pre- or post-synapse locations are the fewest regions that collectively contain at least 80 percent of all pre- or post-synapses of these neurons in FlyWire. Neurotransmitter predictions are from Eckstein et al. (2024). Other annotations are based on annotations in FlyWire and are available in the supplemental material of Schlegel et al. (2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20002368 "adult superior intermediate protocerebrum neuron 064")
SubClassOf(obo:FBbt_20002368 obo:FBbt_00047097)
