# Class: obo:FBbt_20002470 (adult superior lateral protocerebrum neuron 076)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002470 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the SLP076 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior to the lateral horn (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the SLPav2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral mushroom body calyx and the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral inferior clamp and the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 4 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002470 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
