# Class: obo:FBbt_20002627 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP64)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002627 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP64 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior intermediate protocerebrum, antler and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, superior intermediate protocerebrum and antler (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002627 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002627 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20002627 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
