# Class: obo:FBbt_20002664 (adult superior lateral protocerebrum neuron 270)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002664 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the SLP270 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior-lateral to the lateral horn (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It is a putative embryonic-born neuron (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral lateral horn, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral mushroom body calyx and the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral mushroom body calyx, the contralateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral mushroom body calyx and the ipsilateral lateral horn (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002664 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002664 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
