# Class: obo:FBbt_20002847 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP67)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002847 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP67 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lateral horn, superior lateral protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, lobula layer 5A and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral lateral horn, superior lateral protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum and superior clamp (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002847 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002847 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
