AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20002847 "FBbt:20002847")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20002847 "Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Scheffer et al., 2020; Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). Synapse locations are given where each cell of this type in neuprint has at least 10 connections. Other information from Nern et al. (2025) supplements.")
