# Class: obo:FBbt_20002879 (adult superior medial protocerebrum neuron 017)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002879 "Adult neuron belonging to group 017 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the superior medial protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, anterior optic tubercle, lateral complex, inferior neuropils, inferior bridge, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum, crepine and antler (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, lateral complex, inferior neuropils, inferior bridge, superior neuropils and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002879 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
