# Class: obo:FBbt_20002911 (adult superior medial protocerebrum neuron 049)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20002911 "Adult neuron belonging to group 049 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the superior medial protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, superior neuropils and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20002911 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20002911 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
