# Class: obo:FBbt_20003103 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP79)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003103 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP79 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, superior intermediate protocerebrum, crepine, superior posterior slope and lobula layer 5B, and the inferior bridge (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, superior intermediate protocerebrum and crepine, and the inferior bridge (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003103 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003103 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
