# Class: obo:FBbt_20003288 (adult superior medial protocerebrum neuron 426)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003288 "Adult neuron belonging to group 426 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the superior medial protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the mushroom body, superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, superior clamp, mushroom body dorsal accessory calyx and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
