AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003417 "Adult neuron belonging to group 555 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the superior medial protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, epaulette, posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, inferior neuropils, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003417 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
