# Class: obo:FBbt_20003446 (adult superior medial protocerebrum neuron 584)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003446 "Adult neuron belonging to group 584 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the superior medial protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, gnathal ganglion, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, epaulette, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, wedge, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, superior medial protocerebrum, lateral complex, inferior neuropils, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and crepine (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003446 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
