# Class: obo:FBbt_20003464 (adult superior medial protocerebrum neuron 602)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003464 "Adult neuron belonging to group 602 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the superior medial protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
