# Class: obo:FBbt_20003478 (adult vest neuron 012)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003478 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the VES012 group, with its soma in the brain, ventral-lateral to the antennal lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the ALl1 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral vest, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral wedge, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral inferior bridge and the ipsilateral mushroom body pedunculus (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral vest, the ipsilateral inferior bridge, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum and the ipsilateral mushroom body pedunculus (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003478 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
