# Class: obo:FBbt_20003481 (adult lobula visual centrifugal neuron LoVC11)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003481 "Adult lobula visual centrifugal neuron of the LoVC11 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, gorget, epaulette, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, wedge, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope, the contralateral lobula layer 6, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior posterior slope and lobula layer 5B, and the gnathal ganglion and inferior bridge (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, gorget, epaulette, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope, the contralateral lateral accessory lobe, lobula layer 6, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, superior posterior slope, lobula layer 5A and lobula layer 5B, and the gnathal ganglion (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is GABA (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003481 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003481 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20003481 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20003481 "VES015")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:FBbt_20003481 "cL22b")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20003481 "FBbt:20003481")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20003481 "Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Scheffer et al., 2020; Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). Synapse locations are given where each cell of this type in neuprint has at least 10 connections. Other information from Nern et al. (2025) supplements.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20003481 "adult lobula visual centrifugal neuron LoVC11")
