AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003483 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the VES017 group, with its soma in the brain, lateral to the antennal mechanosensory and motor center (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral vest, the ipsilateral wedge, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral flange and the gnathal ganglia (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral inferior bridge, the ipsilateral vest, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope and the ipsilateral superior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
