# Class: obo:FBbt_20003491 (adult vest neuron 025)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003491 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the VES025 group, with its soma in the brain, lateral to the antennal lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the ALl1 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral vest, the gnathal ganglia, the ipsilateral wedge, the saddle, the contralateral vest and the contralateral posterior lateral protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral superior clamp, the contralateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral inferior bridge, the contralateral inferior bridge, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral vest and the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003491 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003491 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
