# Class: obo:FBbt_20003492 (adult lobula visual centrifugal neuron LoVC12)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003492 "Adult lobula visual centrifugal neuron of the LoVC12 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, antennal mechanosensory and motor center, epaulette, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, wedge, crepine, antler, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope, the contralateral lateral accessory lobe, lobula layer 6, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, antler, superior posterior slope and lobula layer 5B, and the gnathal ganglion, inferior bridge and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe and vest, and the contralateral lateral accessory lobe, lobula layer 6, epaulette, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, inferior clamp, superior posterior slope and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is GABA (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003492 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003492 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
