# Class: obo:FBbt_20003527 (adult vest neuron 061)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003527 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the VES061 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the posterior lateral protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the DL2 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral anterior optic tubercle, the contralateral gorget, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral gorget, the contralateral vest and the ipsilateral vest (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral vest, the ipsilateral vest, the contralateral gorget, the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral flange, the ipsilateral gorget, the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the contralateral flange, the contralateral inferior clamp and the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 3 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
