# Class: obo:FBbt_20003528 (adult vest neuron 062)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003528 "Adult neuron belonging to group 062 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the vest (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, anterior optic tubercle, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, gorget, epaulette, vest, superior clamp, inferior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils, superior neuropils and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the superior medial protocerebrum, ventromedial neuropils, inferior neuropils, gorget, epaulette, vest, inferior clamp, superior neuropils and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003528 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003528 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
