# Class: obo:FBbt_20003535 (adult vest neuron 069)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003535 "Adult neuron belonging to group 069 of the terra incognita neurons with substantial synapsing in the vest (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the lateral accessory lobe, gnathal ganglion, lateral complex, ventromedial neuropils, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, ventrolateral neuropils, superior posterior slope, periesophageal neuropils and saddle (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the gnathal ganglion (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
