# Class: obo:FBbt_20003546 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP88)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003546 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP88 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, lobula layer 6, vest, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, superior posterior slope, flange, lobula layer 5A and lobula layer 5B, and the gnathal ganglion, inferior bridge and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, antennal lobe, vest, anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, inferior clamp, superior posterior slope and flange, and the gnathal ganglion, inferior bridge and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003546 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
