# Class: obo:FBbt_20003618 (adult lobula plate tangential neuron LPT31)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003618 "Adult lobula plate tangential neuron of the LPT31 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, lobula plate layer 1, lobula plate layer 2, lobula plate layer 3, lobula plate layer 4, posterior lateral protocerebrum, wedge, inferior posterior slope and lobula layer 5A (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, optic lobe, posterior lateral protocerebrum, wedge, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope (Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 4 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003618 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003618 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20003618 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
