# Class: obo:FBbt_20003631 (adult wedge neuron 081)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003631 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the WED081 group, with its soma in the brain, ventral to the mushroom body medial lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the WEDd2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the contralateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral wedge, the ipsilateral crepine, the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum and the ipsilateral vest (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral vest, the contralateral wedge and the ipsilateral crepine (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is gaba (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003631 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003631 "2020-07-30T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20003631 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20003631 "FBbt:20003631")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20003631 "Uncharacterized putative cell type based on Hemibrain data (Scheffer et al., 2020) and updated using FlyWire (FAFB) data (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). Soma locations are based on the closest annotated neuropil region. Pre- or post-synapse locations are the fewest regions that collectively contain at least 80 percent of all pre- or post-synapses of these neurons in FlyWire. Neurotransmitter predictions are from Eckstein et al. (2024). Other annotations are based on annotations in FlyWire and are available in the supplemental material of Schlegel et al. (2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20003631 "adult wedge neuron 081")
SubClassOf(obo:FBbt_20003631 obo:FBbt_00052046)
