# Class: obo:FBbt_20003632 (adult wedge neuron 082)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003632 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the WED082 group, with its soma in the brain, medial to the mushroom body medial lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the WEDd2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe, the ipsilateral crepine, the ipsilateral wedge and the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the saddle, the contralateral inferior posterior slope, the contralateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center, the contralateral superior posterior slope and the gnathal ganglia (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). There are approximately 4 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
