# Class: obo:FBbt_20003639 (adult wedge neuron 089)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003639 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the WED089 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the lateral horn (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the LHp2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral wedge, the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope and the saddle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral wedge, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral wedge, the contralateral lateral horn, the contralateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral lateral horn and the ipsilateral superior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003639 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
