# Class: obo:FBbt_20003790 (adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron type 4 adPN)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246460") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003790 "Adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron belonging to group 4 (Scheffer et al., 2020). It develops from neuroblast ALad1 and follows the medial antennal lobe tract (Bates et al., 2020; Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the mushroom body, antennal lobe glomerulus VC1, antennal lobe glomerulus VC3, antennal lobe glomerulus VM4, medial antennal lobe tract, lateral horn, antennal lobe glomerulus VC5, antennal lobe glomerulus VC4, calyx of mushroom body, antennal lobe and antennal lobe glomerulus VM6 (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the mushroom body, lateral horn, calyx of mushroom body and antennal lobe (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003790 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003790 "2021-03-10T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
