# Class: obo:FBbt_20003799 (adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron type 14 l2PN)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003799 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the M_l2PNm14 group, with its soma in the brain, lateral to the antennal lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the ALl1 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral antennal lobe, the ipsilateral lateral horn, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum and the ipsilateral antler (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral lateral horn, the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral antler, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum and the ipsilateral superior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
