# Class: obo:FBbt_20003804 (adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron type 13 lPN)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246460") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003804 "Adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron belonging to group 13 (Scheffer et al., 2020). It develops from neuroblast ALl1 (Notch OFF hemilineage) and follows the medial antennal lobe tract (Bates et al., 2020; Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the antennal lobe glomerulus VL1, superior medial protocerebrum, antennal lobe, inferior neuropils, superior clamp, superior neuropils, antennal lobe glomerulus VP1d, antennal lobe glomerulus DC4 and antennal lobe glomerulus VP4 (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the medial antennal lobe tract, superior lateral protocerebrum, superior medial protocerebrum, antennal lobe, inferior neuropils, posterior lateral protocerebrum, superior clamp, ventrolateral neuropils and superior neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003804 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003804 "2021-03-10T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:FBbt_20003804 "adult M_lPNm13 neuron")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20003804 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20003804 "FBbt:20003804")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20003804 "Uncharacterized putative cell type (based on clustering analysis) from Janelia hemibrain data (Scheffer et al., 2020). Connectivity based on Hemibrain v1.2.1 data where each individual of this type has at least 10 synapses in a region.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20003804 "adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron type 13 lPN")
