# Class: obo:FBbt_20003811 (adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron type 30 lvPN)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246460") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003811 "Adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron belonging to group 30 (Scheffer et al., 2020). It develops from neuroblast ALlv1 and follows the medial antennal lobe tract (Bates et al., 2020; Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the antennal lobe glomerulus DA1, antennal lobe glomerulus VA2, antennal lobe glomerulus VM3, lateral horn, superior lateral protocerebrum, antennal lobe glomerulus DP1l, antennal lobe glomerulus VA7m, antennal lobe glomerulus VC4, antennal lobe, superior neuropils, superior intermediate protocerebrum and antennal lobe glomerulus DL2v (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the antennal lobe glomerulus VA2, lateral horn, superior lateral protocerebrum, antennal lobe glomerulus DP1l, antennal lobe, inferior neuropils, superior clamp, superior neuropils and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003811 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003811 "2021-03-10T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:FBbt_20003811 "adult M_lvPNm30 neuron")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20003811 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20003811 "FBbt:20003811")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20003811 "Uncharacterized putative cell type (based on clustering analysis) from Janelia hemibrain data (Scheffer et al., 2020). Connectivity based on Hemibrain v1.2.1 data where each individual of this type has at least 10 synapses in a region.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20003811 "adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron type 30 lvPN")
