# Class: obo:FBbt_20003813 (adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron type 32 lvPN)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246460") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003813 "Adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron belonging to group 32 (Scheffer et al., 2020). It develops from neuroblast ALlv1 and follows the medial antennal lobe tract (Bates et al., 2020; Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the antennal lobe glomerulus VA2, antennal lobe glomerulus VC3, antennal lobe glomerulus DM1, antennal lobe glomerulus DM4, superior lateral protocerebrum, antennal lobe glomerulus DP1m, antennal lobe glomerulus DP1l, antennal lobe, superior neuropils and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the antennal lobe glomerulus VA2, superior lateral protocerebrum, antennal lobe glomerulus DP1m, antennal lobe glomerulus DP1l, antennal lobe, superior neuropils and superior intermediate protocerebrum (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20003813 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20003813 "2021-03-10T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
