# Class: obo:FBbt_20003863 (adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron type 88 vPN)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246460") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0246888") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20003863 "Adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron belonging to group 88 (Scheffer et al., 2020). It develops from neuroblast ALv1 and follows the mediolateral antennal lobe tract (Bates et al., 2020; Scheffer et al., 2020). It has postsynaptic sites in the antennal lobe glomerulus VA2, antennal lobe glomerulus VM3, antennal lobe glomerulus VC3, lateral horn, antennal lobe glomerulus VC4, antennal lobe glomerulus VM5d and antennal lobe (Scheffer et al., 2020). It has presynaptic sites in the lateral horn (Scheffer et al., 2020).")
