# Class: obo:FBbt_20004176 (adult CB0404 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20004176 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB0404 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior-dorsal to the superior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It is a putative embryonic-born neuron (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the saddle, the gnathal ganglia and the ipsilateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral wedge, the contralateral inferior posterior slope and the saddle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
