# Class: obo:FBbt_20004633 (adult CB0943 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20004633 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB0943 group, with its soma in the brain, dorsal to the superior medial protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the SMPpm1 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum and the ipsilateral superior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral flange and the ipsilateral superior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 25 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
