# Class: obo:FBbt_20004752 (adult CB1072 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20004752 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB1072 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the protocerebral bridge (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the DM1 dorsal hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral inferior bridge, the saddle, the contralateral inferior bridge, the contralateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral cantle, the contralateral superior clamp, the contralateral cantle, the contralateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral inferior clamp and the gnathal ganglia (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral superior clamp, the contralateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the contralateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum and the contralateral superior intermediate protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 12 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20004752 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20004752 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5633-1314>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20004752 "2024-02-05T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
