# Class: obo:FBbt_20004802 (adult CB1124 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20004802 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB1124 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior to the gall (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the EBa1 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum and the ipsilateral crepine (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral crepine, the contralateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum and the contralateral crepine (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is gaba (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 4 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
