# Class: obo:FBbt_20005046 (adult CB1396 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20005046 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB1396 group, with its soma in the brain, dorsal to the superior medial protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the SMPp&v1 posterior hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum and the ipsilateral inferior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior clamp, the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral inferior bridge and the ipsilateral inferior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 4 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
