# Class: obo:FBbt_20005061 (adult CB1415 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20005061 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB1415 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior to the antennal mechanosensory and motor center (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the FLAa1 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral flange, the ipsilateral vest, the saddle, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope and the ipsilateral cantle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the gnathal ganglia, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the saddle and the ipsilateral flange (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). There are approximately 7 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
