# Class: obo:FBbt_20005135 (adult CB1492 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20005135 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB1492 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the inferior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the DM4 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral antler and the ipsilateral antler (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral antler, the contralateral antler, the contralateral inferior posterior slope, the contralateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope and the contralateral superior clamp (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 3 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
