AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20005231 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB1601 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the gnathal ganglia (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the LB3 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the gnathal ganglia, the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope and the saddle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the saddle and the ipsilateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is gaba (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 6 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
