# Class: obo:FBbt_20005249 (adult CB1622 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20005249 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB1622 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior-dorsal to the protocerebral bridge (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the DM1 antero ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center and the saddle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope, the saddle and the ipsilateral wedge (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). There are approximately 12 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
