# Class: obo:FBbt_20005450 (adult CB1851 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20005450 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB1851 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior to the superior medial protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the SMPad2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral anterior optic tubercle and the ipsilateral inferior bridge (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral inferior bridge and the contralateral inferior bridge (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 8 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
