# Class: obo:FBbt_20005640 (adult CB2056 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20005640 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB2056 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior to the antennal mechanosensory and motor center (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the VESa2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral vest, the ipsilateral wedge, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral inferior clamp, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the contralateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral inferior bridge and the saddle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral vest, the ipsilateral wedge, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the contralateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the contralateral inferior clamp, the contralateral inferior bridge, the saddle and the ipsilateral inferior bridge (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is gaba (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 8 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20005640 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
