# Class: obo:FBbt_20006128 (adult CB2588 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20006128 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB2588 group, with its soma in the brain, ventral to the gnathal ganglia (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the LB5 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the prow, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum and the gnathal ganglia (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the prow and the ipsilateral flange (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 4 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
