# Class: obo:FBbt_20006150 (adult CB2615 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20006150 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB2615 group, with its soma in the brain, medial to the superior medial protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the SMPad3 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum and the contralateral crepine (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral crepine, the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum and the contralateral mushroom body medial lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 3 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
