# Class: obo:FBbt_20006446 (adult CB2940 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20006446 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB2940 group, with its soma in the brain, lateral to the antennal lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the ALl1 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the saddle, the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope, the ipsilateral wedge, the ipsilateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center and the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral epaulette and the saddle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
