# Class: obo:FBbt_20006830 (adult CB3365 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20006830 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB3365 group, with its soma in the brain, dorsal to the antler (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the DM1 antero dorsal hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral crepine, the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe and the ipsilateral vest (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum, the ipsilateral superior intermediate protocerebrum and the contralateral superior intermediate protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20006830 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20006830 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5633-1314>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20006830 "2024-02-05T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20006830 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20006830 "FBbt:20006830")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20006830 "Uncharacterized putative cell type from Schlegel et al. (2024), based on FlyWire v783 (FAFB) data (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). Soma locations are based on the closest annotated neuropil region. Pre- or post-synapse locations are the fewest regions that collectively contain at least 80 percent of all pre- or post-synapses of these neurons in FlyWire. Neurotransmitter predictions are from Eckstein et al. (2024). Other annotations are based on annotations in FlyWire and are available in the supplemental material of Schlegel et al. (2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20006830 "adult CB3365 neuron")
SubClassOf(obo:FBbt_20006830 obo:FBbt_00052046)
