# Class: obo:FBbt_20006839 (adult CB3376 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20006839 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB3376 group, with its soma in the brain, posterior to the superior posterior slope (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the VLPp2 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the ipsilateral wedge, the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope, the ipsilateral inferior clamp, the contralateral superior posterior slope and the contralateral epaulette (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral lateral accessory lobe, the contralateral superior posterior slope, the contralateral epaulette and the contralateral vest (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
