# Class: obo:FBbt_20007122 (adult CB3692 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20007122 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB3692 group, with its soma in the brain, lateral to the antennal lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the ALl1 ventral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the saddle, the ipsilateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center and the gnathal ganglia (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the contralateral wedge and the saddle (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
