# Class: obo:FBbt_20007284 (adult lobula visual centrifugal neuron LoVC13)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20007284 "Adult lobula visual centrifugal neuron of the LoVC13 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the 03B hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lobula layer 1, lobula layer 2, lobula layer 3, lobula layer 4, antennal mechanosensory and motor center, wedge, inferior posterior slope and lobula layer 5A, and the gnathal ganglion and saddle (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral lobula layer 1, lobula layer 2, lobula layer 3, lobula layer 4 and lobula layer 5A (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is GABA (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20007284 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
