# Class: obo:FBbt_20007291 (adult visual centrifugal neuron OLVC6)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20007291 "Adult visual centrifugal neuron of the OLVC6 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the DM6 posterior hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral superior posterior slope, the contralateral lobula layer 4, lobula plate layer 1, lobula plate layer 2, superior posterior slope and lobula layer 5A, and the inferior bridge (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the contralateral lobula layer 4, lobula plate layer 1, lobula plate layer 2, lobula layer 5A and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20007291 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20007291 "2024-02-05T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
