# Class: obo:FBbt_20007570 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP8)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20007570 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP8 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lobula layer 6, posterior lateral protocerebrum and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum (Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 9 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
