# Class: obo:FBbt_20007595 (adult CB3623 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20007595 "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB3623 group, with its soma in the brain, anterior to the antennal mechanosensory and motor center (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the ALlv1 hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the gnathal ganglia, the ipsilateral antennal lobe, the saddle, the ipsilateral vest and the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior clamp, the ipsilateral lateral horn, the gnathal ganglia, the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum, the saddle and the ipsilateral antennal lobe (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 6 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20007595 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20007595 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5633-1314>)
