# Class: obo:FBbt_20007669 (adult medulla visual centrifugal neuron MeVC5)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20007669 "Adult medulla visual centrifugal neuron of the MeVC5 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the DM1 posterior hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the contralateral medulla layer M6, medulla serpentine layer, superior posterior slope and inferior posterior slope, and the gnathal ganglion and inferior bridge (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the contralateral medulla layer M6, medulla serpentine layer and medulla layer M10 (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20007669 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20007669 "2024-02-05T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20007669 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
