AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20007669 "FBbt:20007669")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20007669 "Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). Synapse locations are given where each cell of this type in neuprint has at least 10 connections. Hemilineage information from neuprint, though original source not clear. Other information from Nern et al. (2025) supplements.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20007669 "adult medulla visual centrifugal neuron MeVC5")
