# Class: obo:FBbt_20007713 (adult AN03B039 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.96084.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97766.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97769.1") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20007713 "Adult ascending neuron of the AN03B039 group with ipsilateral VNC arbors (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It is a secondary neuron of the 03B hemilineage (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It exits the VNC via the cervical connective (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). Within the VNC it fasciculates with the median tract of dorsal cervical fasciculus I (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It receives input in the intermediate tectulum and neck neuropil and sends output to the intermediate tectulum and neck neuropil (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism and their somas are found in the mesothoracic neuromere (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20007713 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20007713 "2024-05-10T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:FBbt_20007713 "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:FBbt_20007713 "FBbt:20007713")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FBbt_20007713 "Uncharacterized putative cell type from Marin et al. (2024), based on MANC v1.2.1 data (Takemura et al., 2024) from NeuPrint.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FBbt_20007713 "adult AN03B039 neuron")
