# Class: obo:FBbt_20008191 (adult DNad005 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.96084.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97766.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97769.1") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20008191 "Adult descending neuron of the DNad005 group (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It enters the VNC via the cervical connective (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). Within the VNC it fasciculates with the median tract of dorsal cervical fasciculus II (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It receives input in the brain and sends output to the abdominal neuromere (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is gaba (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024).")
