AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.96084.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97766.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97769.1") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20010269 "Adult intrinsic neuron of the IN17A110 group with ipsilateral arbors in multiple VNC neuromeres (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It is a secondary neuron of the 17A hemilineage (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It receives input in the T3 leg neuropil and abdominal neuromere and sends output to the intermediate tectulum and wing neuropil (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism and their somas are found in the metathoracic neuromere (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024).")
