# Class: obo:FBbt_20011228 (adult SAch01 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.96084.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97766.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97769.1") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20011228 "Adult chemosensory ascending neuron of the SAch01 group that innervates a taste bristle (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It exits the VNC via the cervical connective (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). Within the VNC it fasciculates with the ventral median tract of ventral cervical fasciculus (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It receives input in the leg and sends output to the leg neuropil (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 45 of these cells per organism (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20011228 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:FBbt_20011228 "2024-05-10T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
