# Class: obo:FBbt_20011323 (adult SNxx27 neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.96084.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97766.1") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.7554/eLife.97769.1") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20011323 "Adult sensory ascending neuron of the SNxx27 group that innervates a mechanosensory bristle (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It enters the VNC via the posterior dorsal mesothoracic nerve and exits via the cervical connective (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). Within the VNC it fasciculates with the ventral median tract of ventral cervical fasciculus (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). It receives input in the thoracic tergum and sends output to multiple regions (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Takemura et al., 2024; Marin et al., 2024).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20011323 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
