# Class: obo:FBbt_20011441 (adult lobula visual projection neuron LoVP92)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20011441 "Adult lobula visual projection neuron of the LoVP92 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the VPNp1 lateral hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral lobula layer 4, lobula layer 6, epaulette, vest, lobula layer 5A and lobula layer 5B, and the contralateral epaulette (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral epaulette, vest and inferior clamp, and the contralateral epaulette (Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 6 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_20011441 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
