# Class: obo:FBbt_20011499 (adult transmedullary Y neuron TmY21)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0259490") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260545") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "FlyBase:FBrf0262545") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_20011499 "Adult transmedullary Y neuron of the TmY21 group (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral medulla and lobula layer 5B (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the ipsilateral medulla and lobula (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 165 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025).")
